nel.","strategicQuestion":"How should a platform explain conflicts, allocation and refunds when distributing its own group securities?","keyFacts":[{"label":"2026 development","value":"GCash distributes Mynt IPO subscriptions inside GStocks PH","asOf":"2026-10-06","sourceUrl":"https://help.gcash.com/hc/en-us/articles/62685551065625-GStocks-PH-Mynt-GCash-IPO-Special-Offer"},{"label":"Transaction / operating status","value":"Offer period ended; listing scheduled for 20 October","asOf":"2026-10-06","sourceUrl":"https://help.gcash.com/hc/en-us/articles/62685551065625-GStocks-PH-Mynt-GCash-IPO-Special-Offer"}],"sourceUrls":["https://help.gcash.com/hc/en-us/articles/62685551065625-GStocks-PH-Mynt-GCash-IPO-Special-Offer"],"reviewedDate":"2026-10-16","ownershipFact":"GCash identifies Mynt as the company offering the IPO shares; this source does not establish the full shareholder register.","ownershipSourceUrl":"https://help.gcash.com/hc/en-us/articles/62685551065625-GStocks-PH-Mynt-GCash-IPO-Special-Offer"},"reviewedRecordCount":2,"reviewedEvidence":[{"id":"gcash-mynt-listing-20261020","date":"2026-10-20","publishedAt":null,"dateBasis":null,"title":"Mynt / GCash completes Philippine IPO listing; PHP60.9bn gross offering","summary":"PSE confirms Mynt listed as GCASH on 20 October. The PHP60.9bn offering combines primary and secondary shares. PSE reports 140,725 GCash subscribers invested about PHP1.1bn through the app.","implication":"Benchmark wallet-based distribution and capital access for GoPay. Separate new issuer cash from shareholder sales before comparing funding capacity.","nextAction":"Review the final prospectus for net primary proceeds, selling holders, lock-ups, free float and use of funds; compare Indonesian eligibility and distribution rules.","url":"https://www.pse.com.ph/mynt-inc-raises-p60-9-b-in-historic-stock-market-debut/","source":"Philippine Stock Exchange","limitations":"PHP60.9bn is gross offering value including secondary shares, not all new issuer